Some times ago, I asked a question on the net:

	What happens if I try to genocide human while I am polymorphed into
other form?

Well, I was able to play the game in the debug mode, and find out.  I
thought the result was pretty interesting.  If you already know this, you
can skip now.


First of all, there are some creatures that you cannot genocide, and human
is one of them.  Now, the game does not classify you as human but as your
charcter.  So, as in old hack, you can genocide yourself by genociding
barbarians.  (while you're a barbarian, of course)

Now, if you read a blessed scroll of genocide, you can kill a whole class
of monsters.  I typed @, and ...

Killed:
	All elves (woodland, green, grey ...)
	Soldiers  (soldier, seargeant, lieutanants ...)
	nurses

Could not kill:
	Human
	Were-creatures (rat, jackal, wolf)
	shopkeeper
	guard
	oracle
	temple priest(ess)
	Unarmored soldier
	Medusa
	Wizard of Y
	Player characters (healer, wizard ....) EXCEPT YOUR CHARACTER TYPE.

So, the only character type you are allowed to kill is yourself.  If you do
this while you are polymorphed, you get all the above messages and at the
end, when your character is wiped away, you get the messsage,
"you feel dead inside",
and die.

It wasn't useful for anything, but took care of my curiosity. :)

